      "content": "Self-care doesn't mean ignoring your struggles or pretending everything is fine; it simply means finding tiny moments to lower your intensity for your own survival. Giving up the endless need to perform is a brave way to stop the exhausting loop from consuming you right now. Your worth isn't defined by your productivity, so allow yourself to stop waiting for things to stop and instead start resting from the pressure.",
