      "content": "i hear you, but i don't mean likeTaking a nap or something. i mean like, what if the only way to actually stop the pressure is for the whole thing to just be over? like, it feels like there's no real way out of this cycle other than just... exiting the loop entirely. it seems so much more logical than just pretending things will get better when they clearly won't.",
